---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <style>
    .about-content {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-content h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .about-content h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: var(--space-xl);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
      color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .about-content p {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .about-content ul {
      margin-left: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }

    .about-content li {
      margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    }

    .links {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--space-md);
      margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .links a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
      background-color: var(--color-accent);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
    }

    .links a:hover {
      background-color: var(--color-accent-dark);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>

  <div class="about-content">
    <h1>About Me</h1>

    <p>
      I'm a Solutions Architect and AI Engineer with 18+ years of experience building data pipelines,
      cloud infrastructure, and AI systems at scale. My journey started in data engineering and has evolved
      through cloud architecture, DevOps, and now into leading AI/GenAI initiatives.
    </p>

    <p>
      Throughout my career at Nordstrom and Synchrony Financial, I've architected and delivered:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Enterprise-scale cloud platforms on AWS (EKS, Lambda, RDS, S3)</li>
      <li>Event-driven data pipelines and batch processing frameworks</li>
      <li>Microservices and API-first architectures</li>
      <li>LLM agent platforms and RAG systems</li>
      <li>CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure-as-code solutions</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What Drives Me</h2>
    <p>
      I'm passionate about solving complex architectural challenges and mentoring teams to deliver
      systems that scale. I believe in building systems that are not just technically sound but also
      maintainable, observable, and secure.
    </p>

    <p>
      Recently, I've been deeply invested in the AI/GenAI space—building agent platforms, RAG systems,
      and helping organizations adopt AI practices responsibly. I earned the "AI Champion" award for
      driving AI adoption across application teams at Synchrony.
    </p>

    <h2>Certifications & Recognition</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>AWS Certified Solutions Architect & DevOps Engineer</li>
      <li>Azure Certified Architect & DevOps Engineer</li>
      <li>Certified Kubernetes Developer (CKA) & CKAD</li>
      <li>Claude Certified Associate Architect</li>
      <li>Docker Certified Associate</li>
      <li>Apache Airflow & Databricks Certified</li>
      <li>SAFe Scrum Master</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
    <p>
      I'm open to roles in architecture, platform engineering, and AI/ML system design.
      Interested in discussing your project or challenges?
    </p>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/vinod-kumar-k-p/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/vinodkumarkp" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
      <a href="mailto:vinodkumar.kp.1985@gmail.com">Email</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
